      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Question for people doing USB: Has anyone made a pad with a ~1.5k pull up resistor instead of the standard ~80k?  The USB peripheral on TQVE, like the original on Tiny Tapeout, uses a separate pin with an external 1.5k resistor, and I'm wondering if I can save the pin.",
