      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "@RebelMike \n```python\nimport gdstk\nlib = gdstk.read_gds('gf180mcu_ocd_io__bi_24t_5lm.gds')\ntop = lib.top_level()[0]\ntop.name = 'gf180mcu_tnt_io__bi_24t_usb'\ntop.flatten()\nnl = gdstk.Library()\nnl.add(top)\nnl.write_gds('gf180mcu_tnt_io__bi_24t_usb.gds')\n```",
